# 📋 Import System

| Keyword / Function          | Use                                               |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| `import`                    | Imports an entire module.                         |
| `from ... import`           | Imports specific objects from a module.           |
| `as`                        | Assigns an alias to a module or imported object.  |
| `__name__`                  | Stores the name of the current module.            |
| `if __name__ == "__main__"` | Executes code only when the file is run directly. |

