# 📋 Exception Handling

| Keyword   | Use                                                 |
| --------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `try`     | Defines a block of code to monitor for exceptions.  |
| `except`  | Handles an exception if one occurs.                 |
| `else`    | Executes if no exception occurs in the `try` block. |
| `finally` | Executes regardless of whether an exception occurs. |
| `raise`   | Raises an exception manually.                       |

---

# 📋 Variable Scope

| Keyword     | Use                                                  |
| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `global`    | Declares that a variable refers to the global scope. |
| `locals()`  | Returns a dictionary of local variables.             |
| `globals()` | Returns a dictionary of global variables.            |

---
# 📋 Identity & Comparison

| Operator / Function | Use                                                              |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `is`                | Checks whether two variables refer to the same object in memory. |
| `==`                | Checks whether two values are equal.                             |
| `id()`              | Returns the unique identity (memory reference) of an object.     |

